    "scenesThatPass": [
      "STELLA: Shit, you scared me!\nMARSH: Watch your tongue, young lady.\nSTELLA: Hey, that’s what I used to say to you when you were little.\nMARSH: I know, Mom, that’s why I said it. That what makes it so darned funny.",
      "ANNIE: Mommy!\nMARSH: Hey, that’s my job.\nANNIE: You were late. Was traffic murder?\nMARSH: No, but...but definitely bad. Let’s see what we’ve got here. Lavender...red...blue...and pink.",
      "MARSH: Come on, nice and tight.\nSTELLA: Don’t even think about it.\nMARSH: But--\nSTELLA: Sweetheart? Get some sleep. Please? Good sleep?",
      "MRS. MILLER: I wish I hadn’t! What do I tell my girls!\nANNIE: Grandma, I can’t sleep.\nSTELLA: Hold on, honey!\nMRS. MILLER: Who would do this? Why?!",
      "ANNIE: Mommy’s sleepy.\nSTELLA: You know, I think she is.\nMARSH: Why do you say that?\nSTELLA: It’s a big deal, you know, turning your schedule upside down. It’s crazy-making. Or, in your case, crazy increasing."
    ]
  },
